"body":"## What's Changed\n* Skills: resolve kicad-cli like the tools do; read datasheet PDFs without poppler (#1417, #1418) by @KochC in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1447\n* Parser/writer text-handling fixes (#1436, #1437, #1438, #1439, #1440) by @KochC in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1445\n* route_diff: take route.py's --json-out; skill names --force-reroute (#1421, #1422) by @KochC in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1446\n* Vias keep a copper ring: routing pins the size, check_drc grades the ring (#1433) by @KochC in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1448\n* Blocked-start diagnostic: do not name lifted own-pad footprint copper as a blocker by @pentolope in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1459\n* autoplan.py: a deterministic routing chain built from the board, and --finish for agent chains by @pentolope in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1264\n* autoplan: planes next to every signal layer, kept clear; fanout and pair fixes by @pentolope in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1489\n* Read bare pad numbers in the 3D-model staging and bus-step text readers by @TotallyNotAHackerTrustMeIAmADolphin in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1509\n* #1387 template check: judge parts by height under a max_height_mm keep-out by @Infinionist in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1510\n* Design brief cans[]: a shield can as one row (#1475 step 3) by @Infinionist in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1511\n\n## New Contributors\n* @KochC made their first contribution in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1447\n* @TotallyNotAHackerTrustMeIAmADolphin made their first contribution in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1509\n* @Infinionist made their first contribution in https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools/pull/1510\n\n**Full Changelog**: 